<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 2.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - July 2.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the close of Wednesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during</p>
<p>the day and their percentage contribution to the net change. The</p>
<p>index at the close was 4333.90, 33.04 points or 0.77 percent</p>
<p>higher than Tuesday's close.</p>
